'''Old Town''' was an area of the coastal [[city]] of [[Canto Bight]] on [[Cantonica]]. The [[Canto Casino and Racetrack|Canto Casino]] was located in Old Town. The avenues of Old Town that surrounded the Canto Casino complex were home of luxury shops that promised a wide variety of rare and bespoke creations, such as the [[Café Raduli|Raduli café and patisserie]] from [[Cabranga Street]]. The [[Canto Bight police headquarters]] stood on a hill above the Old Town, giving the [[police officer]]s in their surveillance center a clear view of events unfolding in the streets below.<ref name="TLJ: VD" />

